			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1371297">
									

<p>I was thinking about this SCP today and I've had an idea (I know this is an old article, but if you want a story, this could be included in an exploration log of sorts. Perhaps one where someone fell asleep or ran into a pipe and was knocked unconscious?).</p>
<p>On to the idea:<br />
<span style="text-decoration: underline;">What is the circulatory system?</span><br />
Various tubes, or if you want, <em>pipes</em>!<br />
Imagine seeing a few pipes linked to a suspended heart's pulmonary arteries, and more pipes branching from the vena cava - the heart still beating as material is pumped through.<br />
Imagine a corpse with a pipe running through its chest. The body could be still (barely) alive - connected to the plumbing. Maybe this is the reason for the screaming. The intense pain of molten iron, or insects, or whatever it is pumping through your bloodstream?<br />
My idea <em>really</em> creeps me out, and the thought of being sustained with a pipe running through your body makes me queasy. What do you think?</p>

